{
  "source": "Prompts/build-your-skills-opener-5.mp4",
  "duration": 189.8695625,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.1,
      "text": "Artificial intelligence platforms will update, pivot, and occasionally disappear entirely."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.86,
      "end": 10.52,
      "text": "The software interface you learned today will look completely different next year."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.36,
      "end": 15.82,
      "text": "But the cognitive habits you develop while using those interfaces are yours forever."
    },
    {
      "start": 16.98,
      "end": 18.68,
      "text": "Think about the first time you learned to ride a bicycle."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.66,
      "end": 24.14,
      "text": "Eventually you got taller, the frame felt too small, and you moved on to a different bike."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.88,
      "end": 26.46,
      "text": "You outgrew the physical object."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.18,
      "end": 32.88,
      "text": "Yet, long after that original bike was gone, you retained the most critical element of the experience."
    },
    {
      "start": 33.72,
      "end": 34.74,
      "text": "You had learned balance."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.58,
      "end": 39.14,
      "text": "Leaving that first bike behind didn't mean you lost the ability to ride."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.98,
      "end": 43.04,
      "text": "Moving on actually revealed that the skill was now a part of you,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.22,
      "end": 46.44,
      "text": "entirely separate from the metal and rubber you used to acquire it."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.18,
      "end": 50.94,
      "text": "That underlying sense of equilibrium proved highly adaptable."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.52,
      "end": 53.84,
      "text": "It directly informed how you learned to ice skate,"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.84,
      "end": 56.44,
      "text": "and it helped you coordinate your weight while playing basketball."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.36,
      "end": 59.58,
      "text": "Whether you went on to compete in triathlons,"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.94,
      "end": 61.96,
      "text": "or simply rode around your neighborhood on the weekends,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.54,
      "end": 64.66,
      "text": "that physical intuition remained intact."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.54,
      "end": 68.0,
      "text": "Nobody could download that coordination into your brain,"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.52,
      "end": 69.58,
      "text": "and you couldn't buy it at a store."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.28,
      "end": 72.66,
      "text": "You had to actively put in the hours to build it yourself."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.78,
      "end": 77.14,
      "text": "Mastering the specific mechanics of that childhood bike was secondary."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.82,
      "end": 82.24,
      "text": "The true value lay in how those hours of practice permanently rewired"
    },
    {
      "start": 82.24,
      "end": 83.66,
      "text": "your own physical coordination."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.84,
      "end": 87.64,
      "text": "We are making the exact same transition right now,"
    },
    {
      "start": 87.98,
      "end": 91.26,
      "text": "moving from physical practice to intellectual practice."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.12,
      "end": 94.8,
      "text": "The skills we are strengthening here are thinking carefully,"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.22,
      "end": 98.12,
      "text": "working closely with others, generating new ideas,"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.68,
      "end": 100.44,
      "text": "and maintaining an active curiosity."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.58,
      "end": 104.84,
      "text": "In this context, an AI is essentially a sparring partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.6,
      "end": 107.32,
      "text": "You will use these systems to practice,"
    },
    {
      "start": 107.94,
      "end": 111.08,
      "text": "but the mental agility you build will carry over directly"
    },
    {
      "start": 111.08,
      "end": 112.98,
      "text": "into your classrooms, your workplace,"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.4,
      "end": 114.84,
      "text": "and your daily human interactions."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.96,
      "end": 119.62,
      "text": "When every person in the room has access to the exact same generative model,"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.2,
      "end": 122.84,
      "text": "the software itself offers zero competitive advantage."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.74,
      "end": 127.06,
      "text": "Your choices, your questions, and your specific judgment"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.38,
      "end": 130.8,
      "text": "are what separate a generic output from a meaningful result."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.76,
      "end": 133.36,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what we'll explore."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.08,
      "end": 136.64,
      "text": "First, judgment and responsibility,"
    },
    {
      "start": 137.36,
      "end": 140.52,
      "text": "weighing evidence and considering how choices affect people."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.16,
      "end": 143.76,
      "text": "Second, people skills and creative thinking,"
    },
    {
      "start": 144.28,
      "end": 146.72,
      "text": "listening, communicating, and collaborating."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.74,
      "end": 150.18,
      "text": "Finally, curiosity and your next steps,"
    },
    {
      "start": 150.92,
      "end": 153.6,
      "text": "exploring interests and choosing concrete actions."
    },
    {
      "start": 154.62,
      "end": 158.4,
      "text": "The principle, build abilities you keep when the software changes."
    },
    {
      "start": 159.12,
      "end": 161.14,
      "text": "As you move through this entire section,"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.42,
      "end": 163.7,
      "text": "there is one overarching question you need to keep"
    },
    {
      "start": 163.7,
      "end": 164.64,
      "text": "at the front of your mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 165.1,
      "end": 167.4,
      "text": "If everyone has the exact same tool,"
    },
    {
      "start": 167.92,
      "end": 169.62,
      "text": "what do I bring that it doesn't?"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.18,
      "end": 172.98,
      "text": "We aren't going to hand you a simple answer to that question."
    },
    {
      "start": 173.78,
      "end": 176.6,
      "text": "The upcoming lessons are designed to give you the raw materials"
    },
    {
      "start": 176.6,
      "end": 178.42,
      "text": "to construct your own answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.32,
      "end": 181.72,
      "text": "Ultimately, remember this fundamental takeaway."
    },
    {
      "start": 182.8,
      "end": 183.82,
      "text": "Because the tools will change,"
    },
    {
      "start": 184.54,
      "end": 186.16,
      "text": "the skills are yours to keep."
    }
  ],
